# --- Agent harness (copy into your .gitignore) ---
# The workspace holds per-task handoff files and is never committed, except its
# README. Ignore the CONTENTS (workspace/*), not the folder itself: git cannot
# re-include a file inside an ignored directory, so `.claude/workspace/` plus a
# negation would silently drop the README.
.claude/workspace/*
!.claude/workspace/README.md

# Personal overrides stay local.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/CLAUDE.local.md

# .claude/agent-memory/ IS committed: it is shared team knowledge.
